a good way'</a></div><div class="news-feed_item-meta "><div class="category-link"><a href="/nba/team/_/name/sa/san-antonio-spurs" data-mptype="category">San Antonio Spurs</a></div><span class="timestamp">4h</span><span class='author'>Michael C. Wright</span></div></div></div></div><!--get: espn-en_story_nba_50076974_2026-10-01T14:55:04Z_false_false_desktop_full_11--><div data-id="50076974" class="news-feed-item "><a name="&lpos=" class="story-link"   data-sport="nba" data-id="50076974" href="/nba/story/_/id/50076974/jamal-shead-raptors-reach-3-year-24m-extension-2029-30"></a><div class="text-container"><div class="item-info-wrap"><div class="news-feed-item-title"><a name="&lpos="  href="/nba/story/_/id/50076974/jamal-shead-raptors-reach-3-year-24m-extension-2029-30" class="realStory" data-sport="nba">Raptors reach 3-year, $24M extension with Shead</a></div><div class="news-feed_item-meta "><div class="category-link"><a href="/nba/team/_/name/tor/toronto-raptors" data-mptype="category">Toronto Raptors</a></div><span class="timestamp">8h</span><span class='author'>Shams Charania</span></div></div></div></div><!--get: espn-en_story_nba_50070779_2026-09-30T21:16:38Z_false_false_desktop_full_11--><div data-id="50070779" class="news-feed-item "><a name="&lpos=" class="story-link"   data-sport="nba" data-id="50070779" href="/nba/story/_/id/50070779/76ers-guard-tyrese-maxey-want-judged-winning"></a><div class="text-container"><div class="item-info-wrap"><div class="news-feed-item-title"><a name="&lpos="  href="/nba/story/_/id/50070779/76ers-guard-tyrese-maxey-want-judged-winning" class="realStory" data-sport="nba">Off career year, Maxey wants to be judged by 76ers' success</a></div><div class="news-feed_item-meta "><div class="category-link"><a href="/nba/team/_/name/phi/philadelphia-76ers" data-mptype="category">Philadelphia 76ers</a></div><span class="timestamp">1d</span><span class='author'>Dave McMenamin</span></div></div></div></div><!--get: espn-en_story_nba_50060732_